WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.664
This is Recetas, our family recipe collection.

00:00:03.138 --> 00:00:05.944
It starts with a scanned recipe, or even a
photo.

00:00:06.501 --> 00:00:09.520
We keep the whole page, including handwritten
notes, then group

00:00:09.568 --> 00:00:12.979
the pages that belong together and leave out the
blank ones.

00:00:13.833 --> 00:00:16.561
The import tools use OCR to read the scan.

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:20.764
That gives us a starting point for the
ingredient list, with amounts

00:00:20.799 --> 00:00:21.565
and units.

00:00:22.308 --> 00:00:25.524
We check it against the original, especially
fractions and handwriting.

00:00:26.267 --> 00:00:30.180
These pomegranate bites span two pages, so we
keep both.

00:00:31.033 --> 00:00:32.925
Now we can pick what we want to cook.

00:00:33.564 --> 00:00:37.593
For this shop, we're making chicken tacos and
pomegranate chocolate

00:00:37.616 --> 00:00:38.231
bites.

00:00:38.777 --> 00:00:43.734
Each recipe has its original pages and an
editable ingredient list.

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:47.960
We add both recipes to the plan, and choose how
many batches to

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:49.051
make.

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:52.122
Next, we check what we already have.

00:00:52.675 --> 00:00:56.063
Honey, cinnamon, olive oil and salt are in the
kitchen, so we don't

00:00:56.086 --> 00:00:57.109
need to buy them again.

00:00:57.862 --> 00:01:01.014
Recetas brings the recipe lists together and
combines matching

00:01:01.048 --> 00:01:01.637
amounts.

00:01:02.389 --> 00:01:05.988
We check the remaining pantry items and decide
how much to buy.

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:08.969
Now the agent builds the cart.

00:01:09.712 --> 00:01:15.285
The preferred integration is an Instacart API or
MCP server, which

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:17.096
can generate a shopping list directly.

00:01:17.839 --> 00:01:21.369
For this demo, we built a Chrome extension to
make the automation

00:01:21.427 --> 00:01:21.903
visible.

00:01:22.542 --> 00:01:26.942
You're watching the agent drive Instacart:
searching Sprouts, reusing

00:01:27.046 --> 00:01:31.528
saved products, checking the family cart, and
adding missing quantities.

00:01:32.538 --> 00:01:34.767
These searches and additions are automated.

00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:37.727
The shopper doesn't have to enter each
ingredient.

00:01:38.470 --> 00:01:41.245
New product choices can still need review.

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:45.583
The agent also adds the groceries we requested
beyond the recipes:

00:01:45.931 --> 00:01:50.030
bananas, strawberries and blueberries, plus
gluten-free pie crusts,

00:01:50.215 --> 00:01:53.153
organic half-and-half and unsweetened Ripple
milk.

00:01:54.337 --> 00:01:56.926
Everything joins the same Sprouts family cart.

00:01:57.669 --> 00:02:00.351
The browser activity makes the agent's work
visible.

00:02:00.816 --> 00:02:04.438
With a supported direct integration, these
screen-by-screen steps

00:02:04.658 --> 00:02:06.342
aren't needed.

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:11.229
At checkout, the agent reviews the delivery
time, fees, tip and

00:02:11.287 --> 00:02:11.751
total.

00:02:12.297 --> 00:02:16.349
Jordi's United Club card includes Instacart Plus
and two ten-dollar

00:02:16.407 --> 00:02:18.764
monthly credits, used on separate orders.

00:02:19.310 --> 00:02:23.385
Here, one credit takes ten dollars off, and
delivery is free.

00:02:23.849 --> 00:02:26.252
The service fee and tip still apply.

00:02:26.995 --> 00:02:31.442
The estimated total is ninety-eight dollars and
thirty cents.

00:02:32.081 --> 00:02:37.201
Jordi approves the purchase, then the agent
submits the order.

00:02:38.067 --> 00:02:41.910
The order is confirmed, and the agent checks the
confirmation email.

00:02:42.769 --> 00:02:46.774
The browser is visible here so you can follow
the agent's actions.

00:02:47.518 --> 00:02:52.162
With a supported API or MCP connection, the same
shopping flow

00:02:52.220 --> 00:02:54.112
can run without browser interaction.

00:02:54.855 --> 00:02:58.849
Telegram or another messaging app can be the
interface: choose

00:02:58.884 --> 00:03:03.528
the meals, add the extras, and let the agent
prepare the shop.

00:03:04.271 --> 00:03:07.615
The experience can be as simple as sending a
message and approving

00:03:07.661 --> 00:03:08.439
the order.
